### Register a doctor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "doctor@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "fullName": "Dr. Gregory House",
  "role": "DOCTOR"
}

### Register a patient
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "role": "PATIENT"
}

### Login (copy accessToken into the @token variable below)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "doctor@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Current user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List doctors
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an appointment (doctor only; replace patientId)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "appointmentDate": "2030-01-15T10:00:00Z",
  "reason": "Annual checkup",
  "notes": "Fasting before the visit"
}

### My appointments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one appointment
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change status (doctor only)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/appointments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### Cancel appointment (patient only)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/appointments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
